    "basicInfo": "The human-majority Kingdom of Solasreach sprawls across the continent's central plains — golden farmland, rolling hills, and wide rivers under a sky that seems permanently bright. The capital Ríocht gleams white on the horizon, its cathedral spires visible for miles. Solasreach is the political heart of the continent: the Royal Court sets trends that ripple through every kingdom, the Adventurers' Guild maintains its headquarters here, and every merchant road leads eventually to its gates. Life is structured but not rigid — adventurers walk the same streets as knights, and a commoner with an S-rank card gets the same inn suite as a duchess. The kingdom's underbelly runs just as deep: noble intrigues, Guild politics, and a hot-spring culture that makes private conversations very public.",
